      "id": "source-variant-8eeda7d063f586a3",
      "original_id": "a00123-8eeda7d063f5",
      "source": "<i><i>And like you, the timeline of my death was no more than a week. My son Hamlet was away at Wittenberg, my brother Claudius plotting to take my throne.</i></i>",
