    {
      "id": "source-variant-569dea9f172328cc",
      "original_id": "a00202-569dea9f1723",
      "source": "You—you did?",
      "source_sha256": "569dea9f172328ccd5bc8159631a57118ab64420bd05ac45b3dbaa0835371651",
      "previous_target": "你——你真的做了？",
      "target": "你——你看到了？",
      "reason": "王后回应女主看到她翻国王私人物品，did指看到了，不是女主真的做了。",
      "origins": [
        {
          "asset": "scenes_present",
          "asset_sha256": "2b1c89384554b940e922d55352639e837524ba2b20d4d642ff3b85bca33bdbf2",
          "scene": "gertrude_queensearching",
          "line": 5952
        },
        "用户2026-10-19要求修正已确认措辞并检查同句资源／运行变体不一致"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-variant-ecae6cef1ff2bd92",
      "original_id": "a00219-ecae6cef1ff2",
      "source": "Or—well—how many times have you used <b>that gift</b> now? Been quite a few, hasn't it?",
      "source_sha256": "ecae6cef1ff2bd923fc0bff2e4c57f0a2d8abf5078e36e7021bcfa46c4493065",
      "previous_target": "或者——嗯——你现在已经用了多少次<b>那份天赋</b>？已经不少次了，对吧？",
      "target": "或者——嗯——你到现在已经用过多少次<b>那份恩赐</b>了？已经不少次了吧？",
      "reason": "昆斯所说gift是获赠的力量，采用恩赐，避免译为先天的天赋。",
      "origins": [
        {
          "asset": "scenes_present",
          "asset_sha256": "2b1c89384554b940e922d55352639e837524ba2b20d4d642ff3b85bca33bdbf2",
